## 3. Sprint Anomaly Repulsion & Trap Immunity

Prevents players from getting trapped or killed by gravitational anomalies when sprinting:

```lua
-- gamedata/scripts/anomaly_sprint_guard.script
function check_anomaly_immunity()
    if not db.actor or not db.actor:alive() then return end
    
    -- Check if player is actively sprinting
    if db.actor:is_sprinting() then
        for id = 1, 65534 do
            local zone = level.object_by_id(id)
            if zone and is_anomaly_zone(zone) then
                local dist = db.actor:position():distance_to(zone:position())
                if dist < 6.0 then
                    -- Repel player outwards from anomaly center
                    local repel_dir = db.actor:position():sub(zone:position()):normalize()
                    repel_dir.y = 0.1 -- Small upward lift
                    db.actor:set_actor_direction(repel_dir:getH())
                end
            end
        end
    end
end
```

