## 4. NPC Companion & Quest Vitality Shims

Protects vulnerable quest allies (e.g. Rookie loner in Garbage) from instant death before the player can arrive:

```lua
-- gamedata/scripts/quest_npc_protection.script
function protect_rookie_loner(npc)
    if not npc or not npc:alive() then return end
    -- If health drops critically low, grant damage reduction
    if npc:health() < 0.35 then
        npc:set_health_ex(0.60) -- Buffer health
    end
end
```

